  "notes": {
    "p0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Discount Vai · clickable prototype (Option D)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2400, "page": "proto"},
    "p1": {"x": 1540, "y": 0, "w": 480, "maxH": 760, "fill": "green", "size": "m", "page": "proto", "text": "How to use\n\nOpen this board (or press Play). Use the dark bar: pick any page, switch Palette, switch Width (390 / 768 / 1440). The back arrow returns to the last page.\n\nEverything links: header, mega menu (hover Men), drawer (tap the menu icon at 390 or 768), cards open the product, Add to Cart shows the toast, the cart drawer leads to checkout.\n\nAt checkout, Cash on Delivery goes to Order confirmed; Pay online goes to Payment failed so you can see the retry path. Try code VAI10."},
    "g0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Global elements", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4600, "page": "global"},
    "g1": {"x": 3120, "y": 3680, "w": 460, "maxH": 640, "fill": "orange", "size": "m", "page": "global", "text": "Popup behaviour\n\n1. Appears after about 70% scroll, or near the footer.\n2. Shows once per visit.\n3. Stays hidden for 7 days after it is closed.\n4. Never appears on cart or checkout.\n\nEvery state here is live: type an email and press Join to go from error to loading to success."},
    "h0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Home", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2838, "page": "home"},
    "h1": {"x": 2918, "y": 0, "w": 460, "maxH": 640, "fill": "gray", "size": "m", "page": "home", "text": "Sections in order\n\n1. Hero slider (3 slides, different desktop and mobile crops)\n2. Shop by Category (9 tiles)\n3. New Arrivals carousel\n4. Vai's Deals of the Week with a live countdown\n5. Panjabi for Eid feature\n6. Best Sellers\n7. Bags spotlight\n8. Women's teaser\n9. Trust strip\n10. Customer reviews\n11. About Discount Vai (SEO)\n12. Footer"},
    "s0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Shop and search", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "shop"},
    "r0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Product page", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4828, "page": "product"},
    "c0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Cart and checkout", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "checkout"},
    "a0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Account", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "account"},
    "i0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Info pages, contact, 404 and coming soon", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "info"},
    "x0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Component sources at 1440 · every board above is built from these", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 15548, "page": "src"},
    "t0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Layout options prototype · flip page, layout, palette and width", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2400, "page": "options"},
    "s0o": {"x": 1540, "y": 0, "w": 460, "maxH": 640, "fill": "green", "size": "m", "page": "options", "text": "Chosen: Option D (hybrid), 2 Oct 2026.\n\nThis page keeps the A to D comparison for reference. Open the board and use the dark bar to flip Page, Layout, Palette and Width."},
    "tA": {"x": 0, "y": 3700, "text": "Option A · Classic grid", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "options"},
    "sA": {"x": 5836, "y": 4000, "w": 460, "maxH": 700, "fill": "gray", "size": "m", "page": "options", "text": "A · Classic grid\n\n1. Easy to browse: 5/5\n2. Shows discounts: 5/5\n3. Mobile: 5/5\n4. Feels premium: 2/5\n\nFastest to scan and compare prices; the -% badge, sale price and struck price all sit in the same place on every card. Downside: looks like every other BD shop, so the brand does little of the work."},
    "tB": {"x": 0, "y": 8160, "text": "Option B · Image-first fashion grid", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "options"},
    "sB": {"x": 5836, "y": 8460, "w": 460, "maxH": 700, "fill": "gray", "size": "m", "page": "options", "text": "B · Image-first\n\n1. Easy to browse: 4/5\n2. Shows discounts: 3/5\n3. Mobile: 4/5\n4. Feels premium: 4/5\n\nPhotos sell the clothes and the swipe-through shots answer \"what does the back look like?\" without a click. Depends on real, consistent photography. Minimal text means the price is the only thing doing the selling."},
    "tC": {"x": 0, "y": 13010, "text": "Option C · Editorial / mixed", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "options"},
    "sC": {"x": 5836, "y": 13310, "w": 460, "maxH": 700, "fill": "gray", "size": "m", "page": "options", "text": "C · Editorial\n\n1. Easy to browse: 2/5\n2. Shows discounts: 3/5\n3. Mobile: 3/5\n4. Feels premium: 5/5\n\nThe most premium feel. But carousels hide stock, fewer products fit per screen, and the sidebar costs width. Works against a discount brand whose customers want to see lots of deals fast."},
    "tD": {"x": 0, "y": 17460, "text": "Option D · Hybrid (chosen)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5756, "page": "options"},
    "sD": {"x": 5836, "y": 17760, "w": 460, "maxH": 760, "fill": "green", "size": "m", "page": "options", "text": "D · Hybrid (chosen)\n\n1. Easy to browse: 5/5\n2. Shows discounts: 5/5\n3. Mobile: 5/5\n4. Feels premium: 4/5\n\nHomepage borrows C and B for brand feel: peeking carousel, full-width \"Shop this look\" image, feature split. Category pages use A's 4/3/2 grid with B's slim filter bar and swipe-through photos. Every card shows name, price, struck price, -% badge, colour and swatches."}
  },
